  'Hamburger Kunsthalle, Hamburg', 'A man in a dark coat stands on a rocky outcrop with his back to us, looking out over a sea of fog and distant peaks. Because we see the view over his shoulder, we share his place. It has become an emblem of German Romanticism and its feeling for the vastness of nature.', 'Written for Salon', '/art/starter/wanderer.jpg',
